This is odd because the user comes all the way from clicking into the Name field, inputting the invalid name and come back, and do not see any error until they click `Save`, then they have to click all the way to the `Name` field again to edit it to the correct one. The feedback loop is too long.", 'proposed_changes': '<!-- DO NOT POST CODE DIFFS -->
