And contains the link to the page linked above regarding architecture errors for Apple silicon, which they also updated at the same time with more info and with Build destinations. It seems that something related to arm64 and x86_64 changed for this version, but no further details exist.', 'proposed_changes': 'Remove `EXCLUDED_ARCHS[sdk=iphonesimulator*] = "arm64"` from `Podfile` and `project.pbxproj` (which is applied to the `Pods-NewExpensify` config).
