**Before**


https://github.com/Expensify/App/assets/6880914/eb1795ac-e19d-410f-84cb-54adfb6ea6c0

**After**


https://github.com/Expensify/App/assets/6880914/63777fb2-27cf-4235-b104-84f34f79ff92


